Patch 0091 (gen2_k -> build/gen2_l), 2026-11-27. Seven default-off switches in CR_P0088, matched exactly ("all" does NOT enable
them). Priority 1 = cloakboard, bushboard, bushpop, evogb; priority 2 = gangair, ghostsplash, ghostcloak. Sources and evidence in
runs/sim_0091/REPORT.md; royalesim = the reference's cards-15535.1 data (15.535.29 client asset pack), read in its scratch env.
  cloakboard  : a cloaked Royal Ghost (card 47; the Evolution's bodies are card 47 too) is written into both players' board planes
                (CombatEntity::isSeenOnBoard). Live: the r5 detector boxes it while cloaked and live_ppo/cloaked_rows.py feeds it
                to the policy, so live already saw what training never did. Targeting unchanged (isTargetable untouched).
  bushboard   : the same for the walking Suspicious Bush (card 85; live detector 0.58-0.96 while it walks).
  bushpop     : the Bush never attacks. On the tick its building is in reach (Range 1.6, was 0.5) it dies with no
                damage; its death lets out 2 Bush Goblins, hidden and untargetable 7 / 6 ticks (SuspiciousBush_DummyAEO delay
                675 / 625 ms), then their own 1 s deploy. Bush Goblin speed Medium 1.2 tiles/s (BushGoblin Speed 60; was 0.5).
                royalesim SuspiciousBush Damage 0, Kamikaze, HitSpeed 300 = LoadTime 300. Live: goblins first boxed
                0.77-1.03 s after the bush stopped (3 pops); engine 0.6 / 0.7 s then the 1 s deploy.
  evogb       : the evolved cast of card 132 is the plain barrel (3 Goblins, plain formation) PLUS a decoy barrel at
                (2 x CENTER_X - x, y), same flight, landing 3 GoblinDummy (81 hp, 66, hit 1.1 s, load 0.7 s, range 0.5,
                speed 2.4; stats id -53). royalesim GoblinBarrel_EV1 evo_mirror, GoblinBarrelSpell_EV1_Decoy, units.GoblinDummy;
                live runs/live/20261124-094533 f010151-f010179 (one fused sprite, two barrels, goblins at both towers).
                Off = gen2_k's 6 Goblins at one point (not sourced). Adds ClashEnv::getEvolutionState (get_evolution_state).
  gangair     : Goblin Gang's 3 Spear Goblins (unit -27) hit air (royalesim GoblinGang second_summon SpearGoblin;
                units.SpearGoblin attacks_air true, the record card 23 and Goblin Giant's -26 already follow).
  ghostsplash : the Royal Ghost's hit splashes 1.0 round its target (units.Ghost / Ghost_EV1 area_damage_radius 1000),
                card 47 and both forms of 136, through the ordinary melee splash (centre to centre, air included; whether the
                real splash reaches air is not in the data).
  ghostcloak  : the Ghost hides again 23 ticks after its hit, not 18 (idle_invisibility 2000 ms from the END of the attack;
                royalesim calibration INVISIBILITY: towers drop it on hit + 46 x 50 ms in 18 of 26 cases). 0040's 1800 is
                release 15.535.13.
NOT in this patch (no usable source; REPORT.md says why): Royal Ghost HP 1210 (the 6 Oct 2026 note says 1152, kept), Evo
Souldiers, Hero Mini P.E.K.K.A., Evo P.E.K.K.A. heal, Three Musketeers' triangle and melee.
Paths below start at engine/; apply from the build folder: cd build/gen2_X && patch -p1 < this. Also adds the seven switches to
p0088_active() (src/bindings.cpp) and python_ai/tests/test_sim_real_0091.py (25 pass on gen2_l; 15 fail, 10 pass on gen2_k).
All seven off = identical to gen2_k: 30 of 30 seeded matches per-tick hash (obs, units, pending spells, length) with CR_P0088
empty, BASE14 and BASE14,all; 150 of 150 replays byte-identical (replay_dump.py 150 7); 1000 of 1000 common-panel rows
(g2k_off vs g2l_off, ep0147485). runs/sim_0091/hash, runs/sim_0091/replay.
Python side, separate from this patch: training/obs_noise.py READER2 evo_no_tile (default [], backup obs_noise.py.20261127.bak).
